    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d90">

                <pb facs="0242" n="124" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg124"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Chang Yen Hoon to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Havana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-02-16"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 16,
                        1889</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I respectfully inform you that the marriage of Chinese Emperor will be celebrated
                    twenty-eighth instant. I start for Washington on twentieth, having been
                    courteously entertained by American consul-general.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chang Yen Hoon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
